## Known Patterns & Gotchas

- **`₹` symbol** renders broken at large font sizes on Ubuntu — use `Rs.` instead
- **Marathi text in PDF** needs `'Noto Sans Devanagari'` in the HTML font stack
- **Overview tab refresh** — call `self._refresh_overview()` after any data save so the tab rebuilds with latest data
- **`sqlite3.Row`** objects don't support `.get()` — use `row['key']` with `'key' in row.keys()` check
- **`isZillowSuite` flag** — not relevant here, ignore if seen in context from search-automation project
- The `data/` folder holds `dentnest.db` — delete it locally to reset schema during development
